  "summary": "Dunder Mifflin holds 'Take Your Daughter to Work Day,' bringing several employees' children to the office. Jim charms Stacy's daughter Abby, while Stanley furiously scolds Ryan for talking to his daughter Melissa. Michael screens an old tape of his appearance on the children's show Fundle Bundle, only to be crushed by his younger self's dream of being married with children. Reassessing his life goals, Michael resolves to start a family and joins an online dating service under the username 'Little kid lover'."
